  "body_content": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n.ck-link\r\n\t{text-decoration:underline}\r\n-->\r\n</style><style>\r\n<!--\r\n.ck-link\r\n\t{text-decoration:underline}\r\n-->\r\n</style><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@media only screen {\r\n.email *\r\n\t{word-break:break-word}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media screen and (max-width: 384px) {\r\n.mail-message-content\r\n\t{width:414px!important}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media only screen {\r\n.email *\r\n\t{word-break:break-word}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media screen and (max-width: 384px) {\r\n.mail-message-content\r\n\t{width:414px!important}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\r\n.ck-mobile-font-size\r\n\t{font-size:50px!important}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\r\n.ck-mobile-font-size\r\n\t{font-size:50px!important}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body style=\"margin:0; padding:0\"><div class=\"email\" style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-right:18px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:separate; width:100%; margin:0 auto\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">​<a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/reh8hohmo55x8eu6u6/aHR0cHM6Ly90eXBlc2FmZS5haS8=\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">TypeSafe AI</a> just launched <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/8ghqhoho75594gulu9/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NzLnR5cGVzYWZlLmFpL2ludHJvZHVjdGlvbg==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">Jev</a>, a new AI model with a pretty big claim: <strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">over 400 times cheaper on certain decision-making tasks than frontier models.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">The company reports <strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">444.6x lower cost and 193.6x faster performance</strong> in its <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/l2hehmhldkkrglhgu0/aHR0cHM6Ly90eXBlc2FmZS5haS9ibG9nL2ludHJvZHVjaW5nLXN5c3RlbS1vbmUtbW9kZWxzLWFuZC1qZXY=\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">published workflow tests</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Behind it is <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/m2h7h5h3lnnermtluq/aHR0cHM6Ly90eXBlc2FmZS5haS90ZWFt\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">Diogo Almeida</a>, a former OpenAI researcher who helped develop the methods behind ChatGPT.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">After two years working in stealth, TypeSafe announced Jev on September 15.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">But there’s a catch: Jev doesn’t write text.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">You wouldn’t ask it to write a blog post or have a conversation the way you would with Claude or ChatGPT.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Jev is built to make structured decisions. You give it information and define the answers it can return: a yes/no judgment, a score, or a category from a list. TypeSafe explains these <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/8ghqhoho75594gulu9/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NzLnR5cGVzYWZlLmFpL2ludHJvZHVjdGlvbg==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">three output types here</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">That might sound limiting until you think about how much business work involves making those same kinds of decisions over and over.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Here are three ways to think about it, with examples you could build around each.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">1. Yes/no questions</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Use it to check whether something meets a clear condition:</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"margin:1em 0; margin-left:1em; padding:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; list-style-position:outside!important\"><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Does this lead match our ideal customer profile?</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Does this customer message need a human response?</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Does this comment contain a question we should answer?</span></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">It returns a value between 0 and 1 for how likely the statement is to be true. You decide what threshold should trigger the next step.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">2. Scores and ratings</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Give it a clear scoring guide and use the results to prioritize:</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"margin:1em 0; margin-left:1em; padding:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; list-style-position:outside!important\"><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Score emails in your inbox from 1 to 5 by urgency</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Score prospect candidate CVs for a job post</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Score draft ads on how clearly they explain your offer, so you know which need work</span></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">The important thing here is to be specific about what a high or low score means for your business and your use case.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">3. Sorting into buckets</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Give it the categories you want to use:</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"margin:1em 0; margin-left:1em; padding:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; list-style-position:outside!important\"><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Sort incoming emails into sales, support, or admin.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Group customer feedback into bugs, feature requests, or praise.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Label business documents as invoices, contracts, or receipts so they go to the right folder.</span></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">You still need to define the categories and check how well it handles your data. A correctly formatted answer can still be the wrong decision.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">It’s also showing promise for fast browser use.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Choosing what to click next is another decision with a set of possible answers.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">In Browser Use’s <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/e0hph7h7dnn4x5u7u2/aHR0cHM6Ly9naXRodWIuY29tL2Jyb3dzZXItdXNlL2pldi11bHRyYWZhc3Q=\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">Jev Ultrafast demo</a>, the agent found flight options from Zurich to London in about <strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">7.1 seconds</strong>. You can see the <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/owhkhqhw088ozpaqur/aHR0cHM6Ly94LmNvbS9ncmVncHIwNy9zdGF0dXMvMjEwMDQxMTA2Njk2Njc0OTM1OQ==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">demo shared on X here</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Jev chose the actions and page elements, while a small text model supplied the words to type. The timed run started after the initial page observation and stopped when flight options were visible. It didn’t complete a booking.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">For everyday workflows, think about where you repeatedly check, score, or sort information. Jev could handle those steps, with Claude helping you research, write, and work with the results.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">I break down Jev, compare it with Claude, and show how to actually use it in day-to-day workflows in my latest video.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">​<a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/p8heh9h4p77xvoiru3/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cueW91dHViZS5jb20vd2F0Y2g_dj1MMktfX29zaEdkcw==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">Watch the full walkthrough here.</a>​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Keep going, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Ben</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">P.S. If you want help building workflows like these, you’ll find practical walkthroughs and 1:1 technical help inside the <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/x0hph6he4773g6agul/aHR0cHM6Ly9iZW5haS5jby9qb2luLWFjY2VsZXJhdG9y\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">AI Accelerator</a>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"email-footer\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:separate; width:100%; margin:0 auto\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12\">​</span><a href=\"https://preferences.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\"><span style=\"font-size:12\">Update your profile</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12\"> or </span><a href=\"https://9047bd38.unsubscribe.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\"><span style=\"font-size:12\">Unsubscribe<br>​</span></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:12\">Ben AI - </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12\">Rua Bela Cintra 237, São Paulo, 01415000</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><img src=\"https://9047bd38.open.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo\" alt=\"\" style=\"border:0 none; display:block; height:auto; line-height:100%; outline:none; text-decoration:none; max-width:100%\"> </body></html>",
  "body_text": "TypeSafe AI just launched Jev, a new AI model with a pretty big claim: over 400 times cheaper on certain decision-making tasks than frontier models.\n\nThe company reports 444.6x lower cost and 193.6x faster performance in its published workflow tests.\n\nBehind it is Diogo Almeida, a former OpenAI researcher who helped develop the methods behind ChatGPT.\n\nAfter two years working in stealth, TypeSafe announced Jev on September 15.\n\nBut there’s a catch: Jev doesn’t write text.\n\nYou wouldn’t ask it to write a blog post or have a conversation the way you would with Claude or ChatGPT.\n\nJev is built to make structured decisions. You give it information and define the answers it can return: a yes/no judgment, a score, or a category from a list. TypeSafe explains these three output types here.\n\nThat might sound limiting until you think about how much business work involves making those same kinds of decisions over and over.\n\nHere are three ways to think about it, with examples you could build around each.\n\n1. Yes/no questions\n\nUse it to check whether something meets a clear condition:\n\nDoes this lead match our ideal customer profile?\n\nDoes this customer message need a human response?\n\nDoes this comment contain a question we should answer?\n\nIt returns a value between 0 and 1 for how likely the statement is to be true. You decide what threshold should trigger the next step.\n\n2. Scores and ratings\n\nGive it a clear scoring guide and use the results to prioritize:\n\nScore emails in your inbox from 1 to 5 by urgency\n\nScore prospect candidate CVs for a job post\n\nScore draft ads on how clearly they explain your offer, so you know which need work\n\nThe important thing here is to be specific about what a high or low score means for your business and your use case.\n\n3. Sorting into buckets\n\nGive it the categories you want to use:\n\nSort incoming emails into sales, support, or admin.\n\nGroup customer feedback into bugs, feature requests, or praise.\n\nLabel business documents as invoices, contracts, or receipts so they go to the right folder.\n\nYou still need to define the categories and check how well it handles your data. A correctly formatted answer can still be the wrong decision.\n\nIt’s also showing promise for fast browser use.\n\nChoosing what to click next is another decision with a set of possible answers.\n\nIn Browser Use’s Jev Ultrafast demo, the agent found flight options from Zurich to London in about 7.1 seconds. You can see the demo shared on X here.\n\nJev chose the actions and page elements, while a small text model supplied the words to type. The timed run started after the initial page observation and stopped when flight options were visible. It didn’t complete a booking.\n\nFor everyday workflows, think about where you repeatedly check, score, or sort information. Jev could handle those steps, with Claude helping you research, write, and work with the results.\n\nI break down Jev, compare it with Claude, and show how to actually use it in day-to-day workflows in my latest video.\n\nWatch the full walkthrough here.\n\nKeep going,\n\nBen\n\nP.S. If you want help building workflows like these, you’ll find practical walkthroughs and 1:1 technical help inside the AI Accelerator.\n\nUpdate your profile or Unsubscribe\nBen AI - Rua Bela Cintra 237, São Paulo, 01415000",
  "full_text": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n.ck-link\r\n\t{text-decoration:underline}\r\n-->\r\n</style><style>\r\n<!--\r\n.ck-link\r\n\t{text-decoration:underline}\r\n-->\r\n</style><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@media only screen {\r\n.email *\r\n\t{word-break:break-word}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media screen and (max-width: 384px) {\r\n.mail-message-content\r\n\t{width:414px!important}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media only screen {\r\n.email *\r\n\t{word-break:break-word}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media screen and (max-width: 384px) {\r\n.mail-message-content\r\n\t{width:414px!important}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\r\n.ck-mobile-font-size\r\n\t{font-size:50px!important}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\r\n.ck-mobile-font-size\r\n\t{font-size:50px!important}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body style=\"margin:0; padding:0\"><div class=\"email\" style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-right:18px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:separate; width:100%; margin:0 auto\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">​<a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/reh8hohmo55x8eu6u6/aHR0cHM6Ly90eXBlc2FmZS5haS8=\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">TypeSafe AI</a> just launched <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/8ghqhoho75594gulu9/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NzLnR5cGVzYWZlLmFpL2ludHJvZHVjdGlvbg==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">Jev</a>, a new AI model with a pretty big claim: <strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">over 400 times cheaper on certain decision-making tasks than frontier models.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">The company reports <strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">444.6x lower cost and 193.6x faster performance</strong> in its <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/l2hehmhldkkrglhgu0/aHR0cHM6Ly90eXBlc2FmZS5haS9ibG9nL2ludHJvZHVjaW5nLXN5c3RlbS1vbmUtbW9kZWxzLWFuZC1qZXY=\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">published workflow tests</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Behind it is <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/m2h7h5h3lnnermtluq/aHR0cHM6Ly90eXBlc2FmZS5haS90ZWFt\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">Diogo Almeida</a>, a former OpenAI researcher who helped develop the methods behind ChatGPT.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">After two years working in stealth, TypeSafe announced Jev on September 15.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">But there’s a catch: Jev doesn’t write text.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">You wouldn’t ask it to write a blog post or have a conversation the way you would with Claude or ChatGPT.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Jev is built to make structured decisions. You give it information and define the answers it can return: a yes/no judgment, a score, or a category from a list. TypeSafe explains these <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/8ghqhoho75594gulu9/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NzLnR5cGVzYWZlLmFpL2ludHJvZHVjdGlvbg==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">three output types here</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">That might sound limiting until you think about how much business work involves making those same kinds of decisions over and over.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Here are three ways to think about it, with examples you could build around each.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">1. Yes/no questions</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Use it to check whether something meets a clear condition:</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"margin:1em 0; margin-left:1em; padding:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; list-style-position:outside!important\"><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Does this lead match our ideal customer profile?</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Does this customer message need a human response?</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Does this comment contain a question we should answer?</span></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">It returns a value between 0 and 1 for how likely the statement is to be true. You decide what threshold should trigger the next step.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">2. Scores and ratings</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Give it a clear scoring guide and use the results to prioritize:</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"margin:1em 0; margin-left:1em; padding:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; list-style-position:outside!important\"><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Score emails in your inbox from 1 to 5 by urgency</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Score prospect candidate CVs for a job post</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Score draft ads on how clearly they explain your offer, so you know which need work</span></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">The important thing here is to be specific about what a high or low score means for your business and your use case.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">3. Sorting into buckets</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Give it the categories you want to use:</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"margin:1em 0; margin-left:1em; padding:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; list-style-position:outside!important\"><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Sort incoming emails into sales, support, or admin.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Group customer feedback into bugs, feature requests, or praise.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\" style=\"padding:0 0 0 1em; margin:0; margin-left:1em\"><span>Label business documents as invoices, contracts, or receipts so they go to the right folder.</span></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">You still need to define the categories and check how well it handles your data. A correctly formatted answer can still be the wrong decision.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">It’s also showing promise for fast browser use.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Choosing what to click next is another decision with a set of possible answers.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">In Browser Use’s <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/e0hph7h7dnn4x5u7u2/aHR0cHM6Ly9naXRodWIuY29tL2Jyb3dzZXItdXNlL2pldi11bHRyYWZhc3Q=\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">Jev Ultrafast demo</a>, the agent found flight options from Zurich to London in about <strong style=\"font-weight:bolder\">7.1 seconds</strong>. You can see the <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/owhkhqhw088ozpaqur/aHR0cHM6Ly94LmNvbS9ncmVncHIwNy9zdGF0dXMvMjEwMDQxMTA2Njk2Njc0OTM1OQ==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">demo shared on X here</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Jev chose the actions and page elements, while a small text model supplied the words to type. The timed run started after the initial page observation and stopped when flight options were visible. It didn’t complete a booking.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">For everyday workflows, think about where you repeatedly check, score, or sort information. Jev could handle those steps, with Claude helping you research, write, and work with the results.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">I break down Jev, compare it with Claude, and show how to actually use it in day-to-day workflows in my latest video.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">​<a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/p8heh9h4p77xvoiru3/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cueW91dHViZS5jb20vd2F0Y2g_dj1MMktfX29zaEdkcw==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">Watch the full walkthrough here.</a>​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Keep going, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">Ben</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">P.S. If you want help building workflows like these, you’ll find practical walkthroughs and 1:1 technical help inside the <a href=\"https://9047bd38.click.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo/x0hph6he4773g6agul/aHR0cHM6Ly9iZW5haS5jby9qb2luLWFjY2VsZXJhdG9y\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\">AI Accelerator</a>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"email-footer\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:separate; width:100%; margin:0 auto\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5\">​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin:1em 0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; color:#17141F; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12\">​</span><a href=\"https://preferences.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\"><span style=\"font-size:12\">Update your profile</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12\"> or </span><a href=\"https://9047bd38.unsubscribe.kit-mail3.com/8kuxo95zr5boh28drlwfkhkzv7lkmt3howrmo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ck-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#17141f\"><span style=\"font-size:12\">Unsubscribe<br>​</span></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:12\">Ben AI - </span